.TH "INSPEKT\-SITEMAP" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-sitemap \- Fetch a site\(cqs sitemap and return all URLs with
page titles.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]sitemap\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]] [\f[I]URL\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetch a site\(cqs sitemap and return all URLs with page titles.
.PP
Auto\-discovers the sitemap via robots.txt or /sitemap.xml.
Handles sitemap index files by flattening all child sitemaps.
Enriches entries with real page titles (fetched from each page\(cqs
HTML).
Results are cached for 1 hour.
.PP
Use the \f[CR]lang\f[R] parameter to filter multilingual sites (e.g.,
lang=\(lqnl\(rq for Dutch pages only).
Use \f[CR]refresh=true\f[R] to bypass the cache.
.PP
Returns structured data with each URL\(cqs title, path, and last
modified date.
Use the index numbers with navigate_to_url to visit specific pages.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\f[I]URL\f[R]
optional text argument
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enflat\f[R]
Show flat URL list instead of tree
.TP
\f[B]\(enfilter\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Filter URLs by path (e.g., /blog)
.TP
\f[B]\(enlang\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Filter by language path prefix (e.g., nl, en, fr)
.TP
\f[B]\(enopen\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Navigate by index (5) or target (parent, up, next, prev, first\-child)
.TP
\f[B]\-i\f[R], \f[B]\(eninteractive\f[R]
Interactive fuzzy search picker
.TP
\f[B]\(enwhere\f[R], \f[I]TEXT\f[R]
Breadcrumb: compact (default), nearby (windowed), or full (all siblings)
.TP
\f[B]\(enneighbors\f[R]
Show parent, siblings, and children of current page
.TP
\f[B]\(enfrom\-here\f[R]
Show subtree from current browser page
.TP
\f[B]\(enstats\f[R]
Show sitemap statistics
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-flatten\f[R]
Show sitemap index without expanding child sitemaps
.TP
\f[B]\(enrefresh\f[R]
Force re\-fetch (bypass cache)
.TP
\f[B]\(enno\-titles\f[R]
Skip fetching page titles
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt sitemap
inspekt sitemap \-\-lang nl
inspekt sitemap \-\-json
inspekt sitemap \-\-flat
inspekt sitemap \-\-filter /blog
inspekt sitemap \-\-open 5
inspekt sitemap \-\-open parent
inspekt sitemap \-\-open next
inspekt sitemap \-\-open prev
inspekt sitemap \-\-open first\-child
inspekt sitemap \-\-where
inspekt sitemap \-\-where=nearby
inspekt sitemap \-\-where=full
inspekt sitemap \-\-neighbors
inspekt sitemap \-\-from\-here
inspekt sitemap \-\-from\-here \-i
inspekt sitemap \-\-interactive
inspekt sitemap \-\-stats
inspekt sitemap \-\-no\-flatten
inspekt sitemap \-\-no\-titles
inspekt sitemap \-\-refresh
inspekt sitemap https://example.com/sitemap.xml
